  "description": "The new student is...a goblin?! \n\nAfter surviving an accident, Ji-Yu is left with the ability to read memories, thoughts, and emotions left behind in various objects. She's been using her ability for the greater good, but after becoming the subject of unwanted attention, she's decided to stop...until Hwa-Yeong turns up at her school.\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
